  "interpretation_lock": "Across five frozen MS3-associated regulators, virtual suppression consistently predicted weakening of network-reachable proliferative/mitotic MS3 programs across HCC08, HCC09, and HCC10. The magnitude and network reach varied among regulators, but the directional convergence was preserved. No virtual perturbation predicted restoration of hepatic differentiation or bile-acid metabolic programs.",
